nodes.prompt:
Feature request: {{input}}

Plans dir: the one the project AGENTS.md names, else docs/plans/.

Do not change product code. Read the relevant code and the project AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md chain. Write <plans dir>/YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>-requirements.md with: Goal, In scope, Out of scope, Success (observable checks), Open questions. If the user answered a gate with revision notes, apply them to the existing file. Reply with the file path and the open questions.

Feature request: {{input}}

Plans dir: the one the project AGENTS.md names, else docs/plans/.

Do not change product code. Read the newest *-requirements.md in the plans dir. Write <plans dir>/YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>-plan.md with ordered Implementation Units, each with Files, Change, Done when, and a Verify command. If the user answered a gate with revision notes, revise the existing plan. Reply with the plan path.
